%% STATUS: TARGET (proposed, not implemented)
sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Caller
  participant API as Calls API
  participant AG as Agent runner
  participant PG as Provider policy gate
  participant L1 as Primary LLM
  participant L2 as Approved secondary LLM
  participant RV as Response validator
  participant DB as Postgres
  API->>AG: Turn after input safety
  AG->>L1: Request with timeout
  L1--xAG: 429 or 5xx
  AG->>L1: Retry with backoff, budget capped for voice latency
  L1--xAG: Still failing
  AG->>DB: Record provider error, no prompt content
  AG->>PG: Is a secondary approved for this data class?
  alt Approved secondary exists
    PG-->>AG: Yes
    AG->>L2: Same request
    L2-->>AG: Reply
    AG->>RV: Same validation as primary
    RV-->>API: Result
  else None approved
    PG-->>AG: No
    AG-->>API: Approved fallback message
  end
  API-->>C: Reply, or apology with callback offer
  Note over AG,L2: Fallback never skips safety checks or validation
